WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:13.500
Many people come here not because something dramatic in their life has gone wrong,
but because life itself has begun to feel a tad bit heavier than it used to.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:28.000
They're functioning and they're coping and they're getting through their day,
yet finding that rest doesn't quite feel restorative any longer,
and their mind doesn't quite seem to switch off.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:39.500
So if you want a clearer and more manageable way of understanding what is going on
and responding differently, then this work may be for you.
